        "id": "SmolderP",
        "name": "Dragon Practice",
        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "Hitting champions with Abilities and killing enemies with Super Scorcher Breath grants a stack of Dragon Practice. Stacks increase the damage of Smolders basic Abilities.",
        "bodyHtml": "Hitting champions with Abilities and killing enemies with <span>?</span> grants a stack of <span>?</span>, which improves Smolder's basic Abilities.<br /><span><span>?</span>: Deal an additional <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">0.25 magic damage</span> and gain new effects at ?, ?, and ? stacks.<span><span>?</span>: Explosions deal an additional <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">0.55 magic damage</span>.<span><span>?</span>: Each hit deals an additional <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">0.08 magic damage</span> and gain an extra bolt every 100 stacks.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Smolder has acquired <span style=\"color: #c93c3c\">Dragon Practice:</span> <span style=\"color: #c93c3c\">?</span>.</span>",
