      "Q": {
        "slot": "Q",
        "id": "SmolderQ",
        "name": "Super Scorcher Breath",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Smolder breathes fire on an enemy. As he gains more stacks, this ability becomes more powerful.",
        "bodyHtml": "Smolder belches flame, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(60/70/80/90/100 + (130% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> + <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">0.25 magic damage</span>. If the target dies, Smolder refunds <span>15 Mana</span>, once per cast.<br /><br />Based on stacks of <span>Dragon Practice</span>, this Ability evolves to gain the following effects:<span><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">25 Stacks</span>: Damages all enemies surrounding the target.<span><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">125 Stacks</span>: Sends <span>2.008</span> explosions beyond the target that deal 50% of this Ability's damage.<span><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">225 Stacks</span>: Burns the target, dealing <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-500 font-semibold\">(0% + (0.03% bonus Attack Damage)) max Health true damage</span> over 3 seconds. Enemy champions that drop below <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-500 font-semibold\">6.5%</span> total health while burning are killed instantly.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\"><span>Super Scorcher Breath</span> is considered a basic Attack, applies On-Hit effects, and applies Life Steal at 50% effectiveness.<br />Damage is increased by Critical Strike Chance and Critical Strike Damage at 75% effectiveness.<br />This Ability can only damage each target one time per cast.<br /></span>",
        "iconFile": "SmolderQ.png",
