        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Smolder lets out an adorable flaming sneeze that explodes when hitting enemy champions.",
        "bodyHtml": "Smolder lets out an adorable flaming sneeze, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(60/70/80/90/100 + (60% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowing</span> by 35% for 1.5 seconds.<br /><br />Hitting champions causes an explosion, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(10/35/60/85/110 + (50% bonus Attack Damage) + (80% Ability Power)) physical</span> + <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">0.55 magic damage</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Each consecutive explosion does 75% damage.<br />Smolder can only gain one <span>Dragon Practice</span> stack per champion hit.</span>",
